Primary Path is published under two licenses.

From release 1.1.0 on:

  The server and its console (the ghcr.io/om-er/primarypath image and
  the primarypath-server package) are under the Primary Path Commercial
  License, Copyright (c) 2026 Hidela SRL. Evaluation is free, with no
  time limit. Production use needs a commercial agreement:
  contact@primary-path.com.

    https://primary-path.com/license.txt

  Everything else is under the Apache License, Version 2.0: the Python
  and TypeScript SDKs, the offline verifier, the framework integrations,
  the MCP gateway, the demos, the Helm chart, the compose files and the
  Grafana dashboard.

    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Releases 1.0.0 to 1.0.3 were published under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 in full, the server and console included, and stay under it.

Every package carries its own license text. Details:
https://primary-path.com/docs/docs/licensing.html
